{
  "file_id": "ID03558",
  "text_count": 55,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "Why'd you do that? You used up all\nof our subway fare!",
      "_offset": 1921,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "We couldn't help it, we really\nwanted some hamburgers...",
      "_offset": 1976,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Sorry! We couldn't resist the\ntemptation.",
      "_offset": 2033,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "It's all because we slept past our\nstop...",
      "_offset": 2075,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Why didn't any of you wake us up?",
      "_offset": 2118,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Well, you know...",
      "_offset": 2152,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "You told us not to talk in front\nof the people on the train!",
      "_offset": 2170,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "So what are we supposed to do now?",
      "_offset": 2231,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Heh heh! Leave it to me! I've\nthought real hard about this!",
      "_offset": 2266,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Really?!",
      "_offset": 2326,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Yeah! We'll hitchhike!",
      "_offset": 2335,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "H-hitchhike?!",
      "_offset": 2358,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Heeeeey! Someone give us a ride!\nHey, heeeeeeeeey!",
      "_offset": 2372,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Hey, heeeeey!",
      "_offset": 2423,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "It'll take Taichi three days to\nget picked up.",
      "_offset": 2437,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Then why don't *you* try?",
      "_offset": 2484,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Huh?! Us?",
      "_offset": 2510,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Yaaaaaaaay...",
      "_offset": 2525,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Hahaha! At that rate it'll take\nover a week! No, more like a\nmonth!",
      "_offset": 2539,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "All right, then, I'll try.",
      "_offset": 2607,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "They left. Why'd you say no?",
      "_offset": 2642,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Well, because...",
      "_offset": 2671,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "It was because of the pretty lady\ndriving the car, right?",
      "_offset": 2688,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "N-no! We wouldn't all fit in that\ncar...",
      "_offset": 2746,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Yamato, your face is all red!",
      "_offset": 2787,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Shut up!",
      "_offset": 2817,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Mimi and I can try!",
      "_offset": 2826,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "All right!",
      "_offset": 2846,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Take us to Odaiba!",
      "_offset": 2857,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Take us to Odaiba!",
      "_offset": 2876,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "It'll work this time.",
      "_offset": 2895,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Girls really are better at this\nkind of thing...",
      "_offset": 2917,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Is that how it works, Taichi?",
      "_offset": 2966,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Well, yeah.",
      "_offset": 2996,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "It stopped!",
      "_offset": 3008,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "We did it! Looks like it's okay!",
      "_offset": 3020,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "So that's how it works!",
      "_offset": 3053,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Whoa! W-wait...He left.",
      "_offset": 3077,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "But he said he'd give us a ride...\nWhy'd he leave all of a sudden?",
      "_offset": 3101,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Taichi!",
      "_offset": 3168,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaah! It's a squid monster!",
      "_offset": 3176,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "That's Gesomon!",
      "_offset": 3210,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "The driver was trying to get away\nfrom him!",
      "_offset": 3226,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Let's go, guys!",
      "_offset": 3270,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Taichi! Gesomon isn't that way!",
      "_offset": 3286,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Sorry, sorry! I'll head over right\nnow!",
      "_offset": 3318,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "GSHAAAAAAAAAAH!!",
      "_offset": 3358,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "He's coming!",
      "_offset": 3375,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "We somehow managed to defeat him,\nbut...",
      "_offset": 3388,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "...now everyone's in a panic.",
      "_offset": 3429,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Can't blame them... well, things\nwill work out somehow!",
      "_offset": 3459,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "The fact Digimon can appear from\neven a river like this means that\nwe must be careful in the future.",
      "_offset": 3515,
      "_length": 100,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "The river... That's it! If we ride\non Ikkakumon, we can all get back\nto Odaiba!",
      "_offset": 3616,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Everyone's making a fuss anyway,\nI guess it doesn't matter if they\nreact to Gesomon or Ikkakumon.",
      "_offset": 3696,
      "_length": 97,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "All right, let's head back to\nOdaiba!",
      "_offset": 3794,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}